Package: apt-registry
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: fotros-dev <fotros-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: apt, bash
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/fotros-dev/apt-registry
Description: switch apt sources between upstream repositories and a mirror
 apt-registry rewrites the URIs of known upstream repositories in
 /etc/apt/sources.list and /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ so that apt fetches
 through an apt mirror, and restores the original files on request.
 It is the apt equivalent of "npm config set registry".
